## Time Series

### DateTime Handling

```python
# Create datetime
df['date'] = pd.to_datetime(df['date'])
df['date'] = pd.to_datetime(['2023-01-01', '2023-01-02', '2023-01-03'])

# Generate date range
dates = pd.date_range('2023-01-01', periods=10, freq='D')  # Daily
dates = pd.date_range('2023-01-01', periods=10, freq='H')  # Hourly

# Extract components
df['year'] = df['date'].dt.year
df['month'] = df['date'].dt.month
df['day'] = df['date'].dt.day
df['dayofweek'] = df['date'].dt.dayofweek
df['quarter'] = df['date'].dt.quarter

# Set as index
df = df.set_index('date')

# Resample (time-based aggregation)
df.resample('D').sum()          # Daily
df.resample('W').mean()         # Weekly
df.resample('M').agg(['sum', 'mean'])  # Monthly

# Rolling window
df['value'].rolling(window=7).mean()  # 7-day moving average
df['value'].rolling(window=7).sum()   # 7-day rolling sum
```

